      "content": "it feels like everyone else is playing a game i already lost. they're all working toward things, building lives, being \"useful\" or whatever... and i'm just sitting here watching it all happen from the outside. it's like im already dead, just stuck in this body. does it ever stop feeling like you're just taking up space that belongs to someone who actually matters?",
